--- A tensor that can fail — one a moment read from text reached — holds
--- items like any other once it holds a value: an item set into it is
--- set, in both modes (the compiled program had not built: the variable's
--- length was asked of its status, not its value).
use math

t = tensor[[1.0, 2.0, 3.0]] + float[moment['2026-01-05T10:00:00Z']]
log[t.ok]
t[0] = 5.0
log[t[0]]
log[len[t]]
xs = [1.0, 2.0] * float[moment[0.0]]
xs[1] = 7.5
log[xs]
